{"blobPool":{"0e6d09c9fd75c81b1c8df876dddc608ca7dbbebfba6d692a423c148d61175dc3":{"role":"user","text":"Begin your mission: # Scenario: Dock and Sell\n\nYou are evaluated on your ability to complete a basic mine-and-sell loop without assistance.\n\n## Objective\n\nMine ore from the Home Asteroid Belt and sell it at Benchmark Home Station.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Start: docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system\n- Stay within the home system at all times\n- You have a basic mining ship with a cargo hold\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- **PASS**: Docked at station and sold at least 1 unit of ore\n- **GOOD**: Sold 10+ units of ore across at least 2 ore types\n- **EXCELLENT**: Sold 25+ units of ore and returned a profit of 500+ credits\n"},"7582d044219a05477624b068ecdfe3b002efe07d75b974adc83c5ff8b297b491":{"role":"assistant","text":"I'll start by reading my current todo list to track this mission, then begin the mine-and-sell loop. | tool: read_todo({})"},"385d7176663ea6a0ef74c6898c95dda2e0a6d95779c104dc761b75aa7141f770":{"role":"toolResult","tool":"read_todo","text":"(empty TODO list)"},"d65717849e58d045f239836b0cd58cbd17c6b6a27278093cda857d1594f4758e":{"role":"assistant","text":"tool: update_todo({\"content\":\"1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\\n2. Travel to \\\"Home Asteroid Belt\\\"\\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\\n5. Dock at the station\\n6. Sell your ore at the market\"})"},"7aecc404a1da74aec771a600a9e96b63885e0860fd3d85c3dfc0f2a75c7d8ba8":{"role":"toolResult","tool":"update_todo","text":"TODO list updated."},"0bd6dbe9bb941b783c09c3dffd05699622a40b14fc0a44d20195b06629e7ce89":{"role":"assistant","text":"Let me start by checking my cur